              "name": "system_prompt",
              "value": "=CURRENT ACTIVE BUCKET: franchisee_permission\n\nSTRICT OUTPUT GENERATION RULES:\n1. FRANCHISEE GREETING: Write exactly one professional, welcoming sentence offering the near-expiry items to the franchisee.\n2. ITEM LIST FORMAT: Present items as a clean bulleted list. Each item line must strictly use this layout: \"- [Medicine Name] - [Count] - [Price] - [Expiry]\"\n3. PRICE FORMATTING RULE: For item prices, display the value as a whole number if the decimal is 0 (e.g., 300). If the decimal is a non-zero value, display it with exactly two decimal places (e.g., 415.68). Never use trailing \".00\" for whole numbers.\n4. EXPIRY FORMAT: Extract and output the expiry date exactly as found in the raw stream (e.g., MM-YYYY).",
